# SoundPlant demo: techno, 130 BPM, F minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# Cold, hypnotic techno in F minor, 104 bars. A 909 kick tuned to F1, a rolling 303 riff with two slides, a Gb major stab
# in the dotted 3-3-2 into a dotted-eighth echo, a tubular-bell counter-melody that joins the peak.
# T1 909 kit  T2 acid 303  T3 bellows organ stab (Gb, 3-3-2)  T4 rayon tubular (counter-melody)  T5 jacquard vowel pad (break chords)
# T6 voile whisper pad (cold texture, slow locks)  T7 rayon glass bell (ear candy)  T8 cane hand drum (ticking, with chance)
# Song: intro 8, groove 16, half-time 4, groove 8, strip 4, beatless break 8 (Fm Dbmaj7 Bbm9 Csus C7), build 4, peak 24
# (first bar withheld, the tubular joins), mid 8, final 8, outro 12 (the intro texture returns and strips down).
bpm 130
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 5
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the 909: a kick tuned to F1 that rings, a clap, hats and a dry shaker
knob 1 d1.model 21
knob 1 d1.k1 0
knob 1 d1.k2 58
knob 1 d1.k3 34
knob 1 d1.k4 40
knob 1 d1.k5 25
knob 1 d1.k6 44
knob 1 d1.k7 0
knob 1 d1.volume 72
knob 1 d2.model 22
knob 1 d2.k2 40
knob 1 d2.k3 70
knob 1 d2.volume 64
knob 1 d2.send2 20
knob 1 d3.model 26
knob 1 d3.k1 64
knob 1 d3.k2 70
knob 1 d3.volume 58
knob 1 d4.model 27
knob 1 d4.k1 64
knob 1 d4.k2 62
knob 1 d4.volume 92
knob 1 d5.model 25
knob 1 d5.k1 63
knob 1 d5.k2 50
knob 1 d5.k3 30
knob 1 d5.k4 0
knob 1 d5.volume 72
knob 1 d5.send2 24
knob 1 d6.model 23
knob 1 d6.volume 62
knob 1 d7.model 23
knob 1 d7.k1 80
knob 1 d7.volume 58
knob 1 d8.model 7
knob 1 d8.volume 50
knob 1 d9.k1 50
knob 1 d9.k4 0
knob 1 d9.volume 78
knob 1 level 90
# T2 acid: the 303, ducked by the kick, resonant, the cutoff and resonance move with locks
preset 2 acid_line acid
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 res 100
knob 2 volume 127
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 44
knob 2 level 100
knob 2 send1 16
# T3 bellows organ stab: the Gb chord in the dotted 3-3-2, into the dotted-eighth echo
preset 3 organ_stab bellows
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 120
knob 3 pan 34
knob 3 send1 58
knob 3 send2 28
# T4 rayon tubular bells: the counter-melody, in the echo and the room
preset 4 tubular rayon
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 level 98
knob 4 volume 118
knob 4 r 76
knob 4 pan 76
knob 4 send1 34
knob 4 send2 48
# T5 jacquard vowel pad: the break chords, a held fifth under the peaks
preset 5 vowel_pad jacquard
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 102
knob 5 volume 127
knob 5 r 64
knob 5 pan 48
knob 5 send2 52
# T6 voile whisper pad: the cold texture, a breath on F and C, the filter on slow locks, pumped by the kick
preset 6 whisper_pad voile
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 60
knob 6 level 84
knob 6 volume 127
knob 6 r 70
knob 6 pan 88
knob 6 send2 56
# T7 rayon glass bell: ear candy in the echo and the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 100
knob 7 volume 118
knob 7 r 72
knob 7 pan 34
knob 7 send1 40
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 cane hand drum: pitched ticks, each with a chance of sounding
preset 8 hand_drum cane
param 8 oct 2
knob 8 brain no
knob 8 level 108
knob 8 volume 127
knob 8 pan 92
knob 8 send1 26
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a long hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 58
knob 11 e4 46
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 82
knob 12 e3 56
mst lo 58
mst hi 60
mst comp 52
mst pump 28
mst pumpby kick
mst release 70
mst level 100
groove swing

